back again and it finished.\n- **Result:** All three regions are now on v2.3.0. The service reports healthy and the error rate has dropped to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The create request timed out, so I checked the incident list instead of submitting again. It had been created, so there's no duplicate and only one page went out. The incident summary describes the failure, the rollback, and the halted first attempt. It lists two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and why the orchestrator stopped during the rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}